    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970410.0659\n\nTOKYO, April 11 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nModerate quake shakes central Japan\n\n\n\n\nA moderate earthquake measuring 4.5 on the Richter scale shook Tokyo and surrounding areas Friday but no casualties or damage had been reported, the meteorological agency said.\n\nThe epicentre of the quake, which ocurred at 8:30 a.m. (2330 GMT Thursday), was in the northern part of Ibaraki prefecture, some 100 kilometres (62 miles) from Tokyo.",
